  <p id="c-nanqishu-046-wangsengqian-xiaohuiji:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-046-wangsengqian-xiaohuiji:p001:m0000" ref="ph1_ms8_hyq_ABAA">蕭惠基</persName>，南蘭陵蘭陵人也。祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-046-wangsengqian-xiaohuiji:p001:m0013" ref="ph1_ms8_hyq_AB">源之</persName>，宋前將軍。父<persName id="c-nanqishu-046-wangsengqian-xiaohuiji:p001:m0022" ref="ph1_ms8_hyq_ABA">思話</persName>，征西將軍、儀同三司。</p>
